  "notes": "{喰|く}らう is a rougher, more masculine variant of {食|た}べる.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n\nREGISTER:\nSenses 1 (eating) is vulgar or rough; senses 2-3 (receiving blows/suffering) are colloquial but widely used.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- パンチを{喰|く}らう: to take a punch\n- {一発|いっぱつ}{喰|く}らう: to get hit once\n- {大損|おおぞん}を{喰|く}らう: to suffer a big loss\n- {詐欺|さぎ}に{喰|く}らう: to fall victim to fraud\n\nCAUSATIVE FORM:\n{喰|く}らわせる/お{見舞|みま}いする is used to mean 'to give someone (a blow)'.",
